002500*REMARKS.       **************************************************
002600*               ****           DOT ACCOUNT TESTING            ****
002700*               **************************************************
002800*
002900*               THIS PROGRAM IS A PART OF THE DOT SUBSYSTEM AND IT
003000*               ACCEPTS THE DETAIL TRANSACTIONS (INSERT OR DELETE)
003100*               TO BE APPLIED TO THE DOT ONLINE FILE FOR  TESTING.
003200*               THUS, THE USER CAN INSERT AND DELETE THE NECESSARY
003300*               DOT DETAIL TRANSACTIONS FOR TESTING PURPOSES.
003400*
003500*               THE PROGRAM PERFORMS THE FOLLOWING SERVICES:
003600*
003700*               1.  INSERT ------------- INSERT DETAIL TRANSACTION
003800*               2.  DELETE ------------- DELETE DETAIL TRANSACTION
003900*
004000*               THE USER ENTERS "TEST" TRANSACTIONS BY  PROVIDIING
004100*               THE BANK NUMBER, ACCOUNT TYPE,  AND ACCOUNT NUMBER
004200*               ALONG WITH THE DOT DETAIL TRANSACTION FIELDS.  THE
004300*               DOT DETAIL TRANSACTIONS AND HEADER RECORDS  (I.E.;
004400*               ACCUMULATED DETAIL TRANSACTION TOTALS) CAN THEN BE
004500*               USED TO TEST THE USER'S ONLINE DELIVERY SERVICES.
004600*
004700*               THE PROGRAM CALLS THE DOT ACCOUNT SERVICE  PROGRAM
004800*               TO INSERT AND DELETE DETAIL "TEST" TRANSACTIONS ON
004900*               THE DOT ONLINE FILE (TEST FILE).  THE PROGRAM ALSO
005000*               CALLS THE USER SERVICE PROGRAM TO EDIT THE ACCOUNT
005100*               NUMBER (SCREEN KEY) AND TO FORMAT THE MASTER  FILE
005200*               RECORD KEY (MASTER KEY).
005300*
005400*               THE FOLLOWING INPUT AND OUTPUT MAPS ARE FORMATTED,
005500*               SENT, AND RECEIVED BY THE PROGRAM:
005600*
005700*               DESCRIPTION OF SCREEN MAP       -MAPSET-   MAPNAME
005800*               -------------------------       --------   -------
005900*
006000*               ACCOUNT DETAIL TRANSACTION       DOT500M   ACCTTRX
006100*
006200*               **************************************************
006300*               ****           DOT ACCOUNT TESTING            ****
006400*               **************************************************
006500     EJECT
