      ****            CHECK DAILY DEBIT LIMIT PROCEDURE             ****
      ******************************************************************

       4100-CHECK-DAILY-LIMIT          SECTION.

           MOVE ZERO                   TO WS-DB-DAY-TOTAL.

           INITIALIZE DOT-ONLINE-RECORD.

           MOVE USER-COMM-BANK-NUMBER  TO DOT-BANK-NUMBER.
           MOVE USER-COMM-ACCOUNT-TYPE TO DOT-ACCOUNT-TYPE.
           MOVE USER-COMM-MASTER-KEY   TO DOT-ACCOUNT-KEY.

           MOVE DOT-RETURN-HEADER      TO DOT-COMM-REQUEST-CODE.
           MOVE DOT-AFTER-CUTOFF       TO DOT-COMM-CUTOFF-CODE.
           MOVE WS-CUTOFF-DATE         TO DOT-COMM-CUTOFF-DATE.

           PERFORM 8000-CALL-DOT-SERVICE.

           IF DOT-SUCCESSFUL
               ADD DOT-TPS-DB-AMT-TRANS
                   DOT-ATM-DB-AMT-TRANS
                   DOT-POS-DB-AMT-TRANS
                   DOT-EBS-DB-AMT-TRANS
                   DOT-ACH-DB-AMT-TRANS
                       GIVING WS-DB-DAY-TOTAL.

           COMPUTE WS-DB-NEW-TOTAL =
                   WS-DB-DAY-TOTAL + WS-TRX-AMOUNT-1.

       4100-SECTION-EXIT.

           EXIT.
           EJECT
